@baseUrl = http://localhost:5126

### 1. Check migration status (pending vs executed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/databaseupgrades/status
Accept: application/json

### 2. Execute pending database upgrade scripts
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/databaseupgrades/upgrade
Accept: application/json

### 3. Check migration status after upgrade
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/databaseupgrades/status
Accept: application/json

### 4. Inspect database tables and row counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/databaseupgrades/tables
Accept: application/json
